  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MOL: Moldova Elections Support Project (MESP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will strengthen Moldova&#x2019;s electoral system by enhancing political finance enforcement, securing emerging technologies, and improving postal voting integrity. These efforts will equip the CEC with the tools and expertise to counter malign influence, increase transparency, and ensure elections are fair and free from undue influence. Activities under Output 1 will enable the CEC to audit party finances more effectively, audit political advertising, and enforce financial transparency, reducing the impact of illicit funding in elections. Output 2 will ensure election stakeholders can mitigate risks posed by emerging technologies, including AI and cyber threats, through targeted training and technical assistance. Output 3 will improve the credibility of postal voting by training officials, strengthening cybersecurity, and launching public awareness campaigns. Finally, Output 4 will ensure continuous
support to election administration officials through electoral dialogues, stakeholder coordination, and post-election assessments, reinforcing long-term resilience.
During this critical parliamentary election period, this project will contribute to a more transparent and credible electoral process, fostering greater public trust and strengthening Moldova&#x2019;s democratic foundations. By reducing vulnerabilities to foreign interference and corruption, Moldova will be better positioned for EU integration. electoral process, fostering greater public trust and strengthening Moldova&#x2019;s democratic foundations. By reducing vulnerabilities to foreign interference and corruption, Moldova will be better positioned for EU integration.</narrative>
  </description>
